        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>科目一 精简500题知识点之背诵版</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 20px 24px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .dot {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e02a1b;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .title .sub {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .author {\n    margin: 10px 0 0 2px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .section-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 18px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #e02a1b;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 2px 10px 3px 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #e02a1b;\n  }\n  ol.items {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n  }\n  ol.items > li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  ol.items > li .num {\n    flex: 0 0 26px;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  ol.items > li .txt {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n  }\n  b { font-weight: 700; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-row\">\n    <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n    <div class=\"title\">科目一 <span class=\"sub\">精简500题知识点之背诵版</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"author\">笔记创作者: 青青</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <span class=\"badge\">01</span>\n    <span class=\"section-title\">1～20 知识点</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <ol class=\"items\">\n    <li><span class=\"num\">1.</span><span class=\"txt\">C1是小型<b>手动挡车型</b>，C1可以驾驶C2、C3、C4</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">2.</span><span class=\"txt\">C2可以驾驶: 小（微）型<b>自动挡载客汽车以及轻（微）型自动挡载货汽车</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">3.</span><span class=\"txt\">C3是<b>低速载货汽车，C2不可以驾驶C3</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">4.</span><span class=\"txt\">C4是三轮汽车</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">5.</span><span class=\"txt\">C6是<b>轻型牵引挂车，20～60岁</b>，需要取得<b>C1、C2一年</b>之后申请增驾</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">6.</span><span class=\"txt\">小型汽车（C1、C2）准驾车型申请人年龄要是<b>18周岁以上</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">7.</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>70岁以上驾驶人</b>，每年进行一次体检，检查是否患有妨碍安全驾驶的疾病</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">8.</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>有红绿色盲、器质性心脏病、精神病、癫痫等妨碍安全驾驶疾病的</b>，都不得申领驾照</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">9.</span><span class=\"txt\">初次申领驾驶证，<b>不可以申请大（中）型客车、重（轻）牵引挂车</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">10.</span><span class=\"txt\">A1是大型客车；A2是重型牵引挂车；B1是中型客车；B2是大型载货汽车</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">11.</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>A、B两证每年审验</b>，提交身体情况证明</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">12.</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>学习驾驶证明有效期是3年</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">13.</span><span class=\"txt\">科目一是道路交通安全法律、法规和相关知识；科目二是场地驾驶技能考试；<b>科目三包括道路驾驶技能和安全文明驾驶常识</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">14.</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>手动挡汽车科目二考试内容包括5项：倒库、坡道、曲线、侧方和直角</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">15.</span><span class=\"txt\">在学习有效期内，科目二和科目三的预约考试次数<b>不超过5次</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">16.</span><span class=\"txt\">不能如期参加考试，需提前1天申请取消。<b>缺考会被判定为考试不合格</b></span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">17.</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>有效期满换证</b>，可到有体检资质的二级以上医院体检</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">18.</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>初领驾驶证有效期</b>为6年，无满分记录可换发10年、长期（<b>6-10-长期</b>）</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">19.</span><span class=\"txt\"><b>摩托车增驾汽车类车型</b>的实习期为12个月</span></li>\n    <li><span class=\"num\">20.</span><span class=\"txt\">手动挡汽车<b>三个踏板</b>从左到右分别是：离合踏板、制动踏板、加速踏板</span></li>\n  </ol>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
